@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050

### 01. Створення без Price, Id і CreatedAt: 2 кг, Department -> 60 грн
# @name createPosting
POST {{baseUrl}}/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Ivan",
  "to": "Olena",
  "content": "Documents",
  "deliveryType": "Department",
  "weight": 2,
  "width": 20,
  "height": 15,
  "depth": 2,
  "value": 100
}

### 02. GET підтверджує збережену ціну
GET {{baseUrl}}/postings/{{createPosting.response.body.$.id}}

### 03. Те саме число кілограмів, Courier -> 110 грн
POST {{baseUrl}}/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"Ivan","to":"Olena","content":"Documents","deliveryType":"Courier","weight":2,"width":20,"height":15,"depth":2,"value":100}

### 04. ExpressCourier -> 168 грн
POST {{baseUrl}}/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"Ivan","to":"Olena","content":"Documents","deliveryType":"ExpressCourier","weight":2,"width":20,"height":15,"depth":2,"value":100}

### 05. Вихідні DTO містять Id, Price, CreatedAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/postings

### 06. Контракт редагування з Id та Price
PUT {{baseUrl}}/postings/{{createPosting.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":{{createPosting.response.body.$.id}},"from":"Ivan","to":"Olena","content":"Documents (updated)","deliveryType":"Department","weight":2,"width":20,"height":15,"depth":2,"value":120,"price":60}

### 07. Помилкова вага -> 400 з errors.Weight від сервісу
POST {{baseUrl}}/postings
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"Ivan","to":"Olena","content":"Documents","deliveryType":"Department","weight":0,"width":20,"height":15,"depth":2,"value":100}

### 08. Видалення -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/postings/{{createPosting.response.body.$.id}}

### 09. Видаленого запису більше немає -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/postings/{{createPosting.response.body.$.id}}
